msgstr "SenseVoice 已安装。音频不会离开这台电脑。"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "A one-time download of about 270 MB (SenseVoice speech model)."
msgstr "需要一次性下载约 270 MB（SenseVoice 语音模型）。"

