#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "How the palette and what else the web view draws is drawn. Automatic keeps to the CPU on an NVIDIA driver without modesetting (the GPU cannot share frames there) and lets WebKit choose elsewhere; GPU with shared memory draws on the GPU and copies each frame, which is faster at 200% scale and keeps every CSS effect. Takes effect when Heyo is next started."
msgstr "命令面板以及网页视图绘制的其他内容的绘制方式。“自动”在未启用 modesetting 的 NVIDIA 驱动上使用 CPU（那里 GPU 无法共享帧），其他情况由 WebKit 选择；“GPU，共享内存”在 GPU 上绘制并复制每一帧，在 200% 缩放下更快，并保留所有 CSS 效果。下次启动 Heyo 时生效。"

