#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "{0} entry can be found this way."
msgid_plural "{0} entries can be found this way."
msgstr[0] "有 {0} 个条目可以这样找到。"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
