msgstr "按含义查找"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "“服务器登录命令” or “server login command” finds an ssh line: entries are found by what they are about as well as by their words, in Chinese and English alike. A language model on this computer reads what you copy; nothing is sent anywhere."
msgstr "搜索“服务器登录命令”或“server login command”都能找到一行 ssh 命令：条目既可以按字词查找，也可以按内容含义查找，中英文皆可。这台电脑上的语言模型会读取你复制的内容；不会向任何地方发送任何东西。"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "Not installed"
msgstr "未安装"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
