msgstr "不记录来自以下应用的复制"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "What you copy while a window of one of these applications is in front stays out of the history. Password managers are always left out."
msgstr "这些应用程序的窗口位于最前时，你复制的内容不会进入历史。密码管理器始终被排除。"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
