#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "Expand Snippets as You Type"
msgstr "输入时展开文本片段"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "Typing a snippet's keyword in any application replaces it with the snippet's text. While this is on, Heyo watches what you type to find the keywords; none of it is stored. “Pause or Resume Snippet Expansion” in the root search switches it too."
msgstr "在任何应用程序中输入文本片段的关键词，就会替换成该片段的文字。开启后，Heyo 会留意你的输入以找出关键词；输入内容不会被保存。主搜索中的“Pause or Resume Snippet Expansion”也可以切换此项。"

